SUMMARY:Breath Medicine: Breathwork Inside the Cave
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**This is a paid event in collaboration w
 ith Asheville Salt Cave with only a few spots left- registration is requir
 ed. [Please register here](https://ashevillesaltcave.com/events/breath-med
 icine-breathwork-inside-the-cave/)**[.](https://ashevillesaltcave.com/even
 ts/breath-medicine-breathwork-inside-the-cave/)\n\nJoin The Breath Nurse f
 or Breath Medicine: a restorative RESET Breathwork experience held within 
 the calming\, mineral-rich environment of the salt cave. This session is d
 esigned to boost energy\, relieve stress\, and support overall health and 
 well-being.\n\nInside the cave\, the therapeutic properties of halotherapy
  blend with conscious connected breathwork\, gentle guided meditation\, si
 mple visualization\, and music for a full-body reset to leave you feeling 
 relaxed\, recharged\, and renewed. With each intentional breath\, the body
  calms\, the mind clears\, and your energy begins to shift. You’ll leave
  with a deeper sense of peace and wellness.
